                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "*This Review has been edited due to Game Updates. \n\nOMG! They finally added it. XBox 360 Controller Support has been added and the game has become so much more playable. Being able to use the right trigger on a controller has the same feeling of actually playing with slot cars. They have fixed bugs in the level creator as well. My first review of this game was \"Not Recomended\" but I have decided to re-write it and and change my stance on it now that I can actually enjoy the game.\n\nIf you're a fan of slot cars at all, Youre gonna love this game. It's the only sim of this kind and has the physics that make it feel realistic. There are several modes to play in even a track editor so you can make all those crazy tracks you never could as a kid. Plus you don't have to pick it all up after you're done playing! You can upload your tracks for other people to try and Download tracks that others have made, and people make some crazy stuff. You can customize your car and unlock several others as well. The graphics are kinda what you would expect from a game like this. Kinda cartoonish but it suits the stye of game. High FPS all around and no crashes or bugs that I have found. \nI do recommend this game and the price I think is fair for what the game has to offer. \n\n8/10 Best Slot car Sim",
